chapter AFP

session Core = HOL +
  description \<open>
    Core: shared vocabulary for the Episodic-Loops operational semantics --
    labels (pc, loopfun, iter), memory orders, expressions, the abstract action
    alphabet, the abstract command language, and the digested program. No
    semantics. Depends only on HOL. (Episodic stack layer 1; AFP-capable.)
  \<close>
  options [timeout = 600]
  sessions
    "HOL-Library"
  theories
    Core
